<title>USA: ING Barings hires Venezuela equity research chief.</title>
<headline>ING Barings hires Venezuela equity research chief.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings said on Tuesday it had hired Jose Gonzalez as its first head of Venezuela equity research.</p>
<p>The firm said in a statement it had opened its first equity office in Venezuela and Gonzalez would be responsible for ING Barings' Venezuela equity research.</p>
<p>Before joining ING Barings, Gonzalez was a vice president and senior analyst at Nomura in New York specializing in Colombia, Ecuador, Peru and Venezuela.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, 212 859-1879))</p>
